WJOlF","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-05T03:18:49Z","updated_at":"2024-12-05T03:20:20Z","body":"It would be okay just to “select” Node2D or Node3D and enter the transform mode.\r\n\r\nHowever, since TrackKey is a local transform value, it should be necessary to temporarily force Local Transform mode while KeyEdit mode, and restore the original mode/state of the gizmo after breaking the KeyEdit.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2519001413/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2523930699","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99696#issuecomment-2523930699","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99696","id":2523930699,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WcCBL","user":{"login":"alavacek","id":73803703,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc